  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed subdivision of the dwellinghouse to two flats would result in the loss of a family-sized unit of 3+ bedrooms. It would be an unsustainable form of development which causes harm to the housing size and mix of the borough, which therefore directly conflicts with Policy 15 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of any legal agreement, the proposal fails to provide the necessary financial contributions to secure adequate mitigation against the Epping Forest Special Area of Conservation and therefore fails to comply with Policy 81 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024) and the Supplementary Planning Document - Planning Obligations (2017). It also fails to secure financial contributions to secure mitigation of the development which would benefit current and future users of the public highway network.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of a legal agreement to restrict current and future occupiers in obtaining on-street parking permits, the proposal constitutes unsustainable development in that it does not promote a shift towards sustainable modes of transport, which conflicts with the objectives of Policies 60 and 66 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
